references:
  - type: software
    title: "Skill Judge"
    url: "https://github.com/softaworks/agent-toolkit/blob/3027f20f3181758385a1bb8c022d4041dfb4de84/skills/skill-judge/README.md"
    authors:
      - name: "softaworks"
    scope: >-
      Static SKILL.md-quality-scoring framework mined for transferable
      eval-design lessons (freedom calibration, design pattern, triggering
      as a failure mode) in references/skill-judge-lessons.md; the
      framework itself is not adopted, see references/skill-judge/README.md.
  - type: software
    title: "agent-skills-eval"
    url: "https://github.com/darkrishabh/agent-skills-eval/tree/b60eebe3c6edaa917a284e13b9b0e9fa00f1c957"
    authors:
      - name: "darkrishabh"
    scope: >-
      Reference implementation of the native agentskills.io evals/evals.json
      methodology (README.md, src/types.ts, src/provider.ts, src/config.ts)
      mined for transferable eval-design patterns in
      references/agent-skills-native-evals.md; not a target format for
      this skill, see references/agent-skills-eval/.
  - type: website
    title: "agentskills.io documentation"
    url: "https://github.com/agentskills/agentskills/tree/38a2ff82958afee88dadf4831509e6f7e9d8ef4e/docs"
    authors:
      - name: "agentskills"
    scope: >-
      General agentskills.io documentation tree indexed in
      references/SUMMARY.md.
  - type: website
    title: "Evaluating skill output quality"
    url: "https://github.com/agentskills/agentskills/blob/38a2ff82958afee88dadf4831509e6f7e9d8ef4e/docs/skill-creation/evaluating-skills.mdx"
    authors:
      - name: "agentskills"
    scope: >-
      Canonical agentskills.io guide to eval-driven skill iteration,
      condensed in references/agent-skills-native-evals.md and
      references/agentskills/evaluating-skills.md.
  - type: website
    title: "Promptfoo Documentation"
    url: "https://www.promptfoo.dev/docs/"
    authors:
      - name: "Promptfoo"
    scope: >-
      Target eval framework for this skill's authored artifacts. Cited
      pages: Test Agent Skills guide, Deterministic Metrics, LLM Rubric,
      Search-Rubric, and the Javascript custom-provider reference,
      condensed in references/promptfoo-agent-skill-testing.md with
      full-fidelity captures under references/promptfoo/.
  - type: generic
    title: "How to test multi-turn conversations with tool calls?"
